 "source_instruction": "i am looking for a black fast wireless universal charging stand.",
 "query": "Ugh, my roommate\u2019s cat knocked over my favorite ceramic mug this morning and spilled oat milk all over my stack of comic books, so I spent 20 minutes blotting pages with paper towels before I even left the apartment. The barista at my usual coffee shop messed up my order too, giving me a vanilla latte instead of the iced Americano I usually get, and it was way too sweet to finish on the walk over. I heard the black chargers in this section that do fast charging and wireless charging usually sit around that $40 price point, and people say those work really well for anyone who hates fumbling with cords when their battery dies mid-commute.",
